exports[`git.package.patch.sh given: [case1] a pnpm repo with one installed version of is-number when: [t4] set (seal) runs in apply mode then: the note says to drop the entry before the upgrade, not after 1`] = `
"# local patch: is-number@7.0.0

- who: <who>
- when: <date>
- why: reef fix: treat a numeric string with whitespace as not a number
- upstream: https://github.com/jonschlinkert/is-number/issues/42
- patch: patches/is-number@7.0.0.patch

retire this patch once the upstream fix ships: first drop its patchedDependencies
entry and delete both this note and the patch, then upgrade past it. a patch that
no longer fits the new version aborts the install, so the drop must come first.
"
`;

