exports[`git.package.patch.sh given: [case13] a gated package (rhachet-roles-bhrain) on disk when: [t1] set (open) names it with no grant then: it is refused with the upstream and the grant as the fix 1`] = `
"🐢 bummer dude...

🐚 git.package.patch set
   └─ ✋ ConstraintError: rhachet-roles-bhrain grades or gates this tree; a clone never patches it here without a human's grant

🥥 did you know?
   ├─ cure it upstream, where its own review judges it:
   ├─ rhx radio.task.push --via gh.issues --into ehmpathy/rhachet-roles-bhrain --title '<title>' --description @stdin
   ├─ or a human admits it to an in-tree patch, at their own terminal:
   └─ rhx git.package.patch.uses allow --package rhachet-roles-bhrain --why '<why>'
"
`;

exports[`git.package.patch.sh given: [case13] a gated package (rhachet-roles-bhrain) on disk when: [t6] a human allows it with a why then: the grant lands in a gitignored meter 1`] = `
"🐢 radical! let's ride!

🐚 git.package.patch.uses allow
   ├─ package: rhachet-roles-bhrain
   ├─ why: hold the review guard quiet until bhrain#88 ships
   └─ grant: a clone may set an in-tree patch of rhachet-roles-bhrain

🥥 did you know?
   ├─ withdraw it once the upstream fix ships
   └─ rhx git.package.patch.uses block --package rhachet-roles-bhrain
"
`;

